[T] STRUCTURE: W = cos(theta_i-theta_j) has W_ii = 1 for ALL i => critical graph = entire
    diagonal (n-fold degenerate) => tropical spectral gap = 0 => tropical Delta = 0.
    The exact gap is carried entirely by the PREFACTOR: the Gaussian width 1/sqrt(beta)
    (Van Vleck) times the compact measure.  In the non-compact (free) case the same
    computation gives a CONTINUOUS spectrum with no gap at all -- the discretisation/
    compactness is what creates the gap, and compactness is a measure, not an action,
    property.  Neither is a tropical datum.

